"            40张斗牛用牌1到10\n            1.三同牛对10 普通牛对10一样大 如111和对10 999和对10 235和对10 118和对10一样大\n            2.三同牛对5 普通牛对5一样大 (比如111和对5 999和对5 235和对5 118和对5都是一样大)\n            3.牛牛 三同牛和普通牛都一样大\n            4.有牛+对子 有牛+99>有牛+88>有牛+77>有牛+66>有牛\n            +44>有牛+33>有牛+22>有牛+11,三同牛和普通牛一样大\n            5.牛9最大 牛1最小三同牛和普通牛\n            一样大 同点一样大不分花色\n            6.无斗的都一样" = "            Dou Niu with 40 cards, using cards 1 through 10\n            1. A three-of-a-kind Niu with a pair of 10s and an ordinary Niu with a pair of 10s rank the same; for example, 111 with a pair of 10s, 999 with a pair of 10s, 235 with a pair of 10s and 118 with a pair of 10s are all equal\n            2. A three-of-a-kind Niu with a pair of 5s and an ordinary Niu with a pair of 5s rank the same (for example, 111 with a pair of 5s, 999 with a pair of 5s, 235 with a pair of 5s and 118 with a pair of 5s are all equal)\n            3. For Niu Niu, a three-of-a-kind Niu and an ordinary Niu rank the same\n            4. For a Niu plus a pair: Niu+99 > Niu+88 > Niu+77 > Niu+66 > Niu\n            +44 > Niu+33 > Niu+22 > Niu+11; a three-of-a-kind Niu and an ordinary Niu rank the same\n            5. Niu 9 is the highest and Niu 1 is the lowest; a three-of-a-kind Niu and an ordinary Niu\n            rank the same; hands with the same points are equal and suits do not matter\n            6. All hands with no Niu are equal";
"            人数扑克张数:40张。用牌1-10 三条算牛 10算1点,同点一样大\n            1)5个1\n            2)5张相加=10\n            3)牛牛>5张相加为9>牛9>5张相加为8>牛8>5张相加为7>牛7>5张相加为6>牛6>牛5>牛4>牛3>牛2>牛1\n            4)同点同牛无牛一样大" = "            Players and deck size: 40 cards. Cards 1-10 are used; three of a kind counts as a Niu; a 10 counts as 1 point; hands with the same points are equal\n            1) Five 1s\n            2) The five cards add up to 10\n            3) Niu Niu > five cards adding up to 9 > Niu 9 > five cards adding up to 8 > Niu 8 > five cards adding up to 7 > Niu 7 > five cards adding up to 6 > Niu 6 > Niu 5 > Niu 4 > Niu 3 > Niu 2 > Niu 1\n            4) Hands with the same points, hands with the same Niu and hands with no Niu are equal";
"            用牌40张：1-10\n            1）炸弹10101010>9999>...111\n            2) 葫芦 101010>999>...111\n            3) 牛10>牛9>牛8>...牛1，同牛比最大牌，同牌一样大\n            4）无牛比最大牌，同牌一样大" = "            40 cards are used: 1-10\n            1) Bomb: 10101010 > 9999 > ... > 111\n            2) Full House: 101010 > 999 > ... > 111\n            3) Niu 10 > Niu 9 > Niu 8 > ... > Niu 1; if players have the same Niu, compare the highest card, and if those cards are also the same the hands are equal\n            4) If no one has a Niu, compare the highest card, and if those cards are the same the hands are equal";
"           看自己手里的第一张牌，根据色牌发牌，报下轮最大次大位置。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。比如报:1张 21，2张 32，3张41，4张12.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张21”表示下轮位置2最大，位置1次大，如果自己是发牌的第2张，选“2张32”表示下轮位置3最大，位置2次大" = "           Look at the first card in your own hand. Cards are dealt according to the marked card, and the app announces which positions will be the highest and the second highest next round. It announces four results; choose the one that matches which card of the deal your own first card was. For example, it announces: card 1 21, card 2 32, card 3 41, card 4 12. If your own card was the 1st card dealt, choose \"card 1 21\", which means that next round position 2 is the highest and position 1 is the second highest; if your own card was the 2nd card dealt, choose \"card 2 32\", which means that next round position 3 is the highest and position 2 is the second highest";
"           看自己手里的第一张牌，根据色牌发牌，报下轮最大次大位置和生死门。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。\n                比如报:1张 212，2张 322，3张 410，4张120.\n                如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张212”表示下轮位置2最大，位置1次大，活门2.如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张322”表示下轮位置3最大，位置2次大，活门2" = "           Look at the first card in your own hand. Cards are dealt according to the marked card, and the app announces which positions will be the highest and the second highest next round, plus the live and dead gates. It announces four results; choose the one that matches which card of the deal your own first card was.\n                For example, it announces: card 1 212, card 2 322, card 3 410, card 4 120.\n                If your own card was the 1st card dealt, choose \"card 1 212\", which means that next round position 2 is the highest, position 1 is the second highest and gate 2 is live. If your own card was the 2nd card dealt, choose \"card 2 322\", which means that next round position 3 is the highest, position 2 is the second highest and gate 2 is live";
"          看自己手里的第一张牌，根据色牌发牌，报下轮最大位置。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。\n        比如报:1张2，2张3，3张4，4张1.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张2”表示下轮位置2最大如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张3”表示下轮位置3最大\n        " = "          Look at the first card in your own hand. Cards are dealt according to the marked card, and the app announces which position will be the highest next round. It announces four results; choose the one that matches which card of the deal your own first card was.\n        For example, it announces: card 1 2, card 2 3, card 3 4, card 4 1. If your own card was the 1st card dealt, choose \"card 1 2\", which means position 2 is the highest next round. If your own card was the 2nd card dealt, choose \"card 2 3\", which means position 3 is the highest next round\n        ";
