"         看自己手里的第一张牌，根据色牌发牌，报下轮最大位置。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择今个结果比如报:1张2，2张 3，3张4，4张1.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张2”表示下轮位置2最大。如果自己是发牌的的第2张，选择“2张3”表示下轮位置3最大......" = "         Look at the first card in your own hand. Cards are dealt according to the marked card, and the app announces which position will be the highest next round. It announces four results; choose the one that matches which card of the deal your own first card was. For example, it announces: card 1 2, card 2 3, card 3 4, card 4 1. If your own card was the 1st card dealt, choose \"card 1 2\", which means position 2 is the highest next round. If your own card was the 2nd card dealt, choose \"card 2 3\", which means position 3 is the highest next round......";
"        底2张相加为色:比如底2张是7和9。7+9=16，最终色=16-10=6点。比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报 1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换，可保位置最大" = "        Add the two bottom cards together to get the mark: for example, if the two bottom cards are 7 and 9, then 7+9=16, so the final mark is 16-10=6 points. For example, an announcement of 1,2 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of the 1st dealing round, which locks your position as the highest. An announcement of 1,2;2,3 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards in the 1st round and the 3rd and 4th cards in the 2nd round, which locks your position as the highest";
"        底牌为色牌。色牌先发。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最大" = "        The bottom card is the marked card, and the marked card is dealt first. For example, an announcement of 1,2 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of the 1st dealing round, which locks your position as the highest. An announcement of 1,2;2,3 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards in the 1st round and the 3rd and 4th cards in the 2nd round. This locks your position as the highest";
"        底牌为色牌。色牌先发。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最小。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第 4张交换。可保位置最小" = "        The bottom card is the marked card, and the marked card is dealt first. For example, an announcement of 1,2 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of the 1st dealing round, which locks your position as the lowest. An announcement of 1,2;2,3 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards in the 1st round and the 3rd and 4th cards in the 2nd round. This locks your position as the lowest";
"        报 15,19=第15张到19张都可用来打色，可保位置最小次小。打色范围可由XY参数修改，默认是 X=1,Y=10。一般修改为X=1.Y=54,整幅牌里面查找打色牌\n" = "        An announcement of 15,19 means that any card from the 15th to the 19th can be used to mark, which locks your position as the lowest and the second lowest. The marking range can be changed with the X and Y parameters; the default is X=1,Y=10. It is usually changed to X=1,Y=54 so that the app searches the whole deck for a card to mark\n";
"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保位置最大。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10。表示在上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1,Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声 0=找不到满足条件的牌" = "        The app announces how many face cards to discard in order to lock your position as the highest. The range for discarding face cards is set by the X and Y parameters: the default is X=1,Y=10, which means face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards. Changing it to X=1,Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the first 5 cards. A 0 in the female voice means your position is already the highest without discarding anything. A 0 in the male voice means no card meets the condition";
"        报去掉多少张面牌，可保多轮位置最大次大次数最多。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上 10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1,Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能满足条件。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌。如果需要玩4轮，就把连报轮数设定为4。报 1 3 4= 去掉1张面牌。第3轮4轮位置最大次大\n        " = "        The app announces how many face cards to discard so that, over several rounds, your position is the highest and the second highest as many times as possible. The range for discarding face cards is set by the X and Y parameters: the default is X=1,Y=10, which means face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards. Changing it to X=1,Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the first 5 cards. A 0 in the female voice means the condition is already met without discarding anything. A 0 in the male voice means no card meets the condition. If you want to play 4 rounds, set the number of consecutive announced rounds to 4. An announcement of 1 3 4 means: discard 1 face card, and then in rounds 3 and 4 your position will be the highest and the second highest\n        ";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，色牌先发，可保位置最大。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10表示在上 10张内打色。修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色" = "        The app announces at which card to mark; the marked card is dealt first, and this locks your position as the highest. The marking range is set by the X and Y parameters: the default is X=1,Y=10, which means the mark is made within the top 10 cards. Changing it to X=5,Y=10 means the mark is made between the 5th and the 10th card";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，色牌先发，可保位置最大次大。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10。表示在上10张内打色。修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色" = "        The app announces at which card to mark; the marked card is dealt first, and this locks your position as the highest and the second highest. The marking range is set by the X and Y parameters: the default is X=1,Y=10, which means the mark is made within the top 10 cards. Changing it to X=5,Y=10 means the mark is made between the 5th and the 10th card";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，色牌先发，可保位置最小。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内打色。修改为:X=5，Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色。" = "        The app announces at which card to mark; the marked card is dealt first, and this locks your position as the lowest. The marking range is set by the X and Y parameters: the default is X=1,Y=10, which means the mark is made within the top 10 cards. Changing it to X=5,Y=10 means the mark is made between the 5th and the 10th card.";
"        报在第几张牌处打色，色牌先发，可保位置最小次小。打色范围有参数XY设定: 默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内打色X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色" = "        The app announces at which card to mark; the marked card is dealt first, and this locks your position as the lowest and the second lowest. The marking range is set by the X and Y parameters: the default is X=1,Y=10, which means the mark is made within the top 10 cards. X=5,Y=10 means the mark is made between the 5th and the 10th card";
"        梭哈专用。报去掉多少张面牌，可保位置最大。优先保位置有最大对子。按报下轮，报后续4张单张数字。去面牌范围由X，Y决定。默认X=1,Y=10.表示在 上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1,Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌" = "        For Show Hand only. The app announces how many face cards to discard in order to lock your position as the highest, giving priority to the position that holds the highest pair. Press announce next round and it will announce the values of the following 4 single cards. The range for discarding face cards is set by X and Y. The default is X=1,Y=10, which means face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards. Changing it to X=1,Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the first 5 cards. A 0 in the female voice means your position is already the highest without discarding anything. A 0 in the male voice means no card meets the condition";
"        每人先发一张牌，哪家牌点数最大，后续牌从最大家继续发。报哪家最大。拿第一张牌的定义为第1家比如报:1张2，2张 3，3张4，4张1.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张2”表示第2家最大.\n        如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张3”表示第3家最大\n        注意:第1轮开始报!" = "        Each player is dealt one card first; whichever player has the highest card value, dealing continues from that player. The app announces which player is the highest. The player who takes the first card is defined as player 1. For example, it announces: card 1 2, card 2 3, card 3 4, card 4 1. If your own card was the 1st card dealt, choose \"card 1 2\", which means player 2 is the highest.\n        If your own card was the 2nd card dealt, choose \"card 2 3\", which means player 3 is the highest\n        Note: announcing starts from round 1!";
"        比如报24，表示去掉2张面牌补到底部可保第3门第4门是最大次大，最大家是4。保34门, 去面牌的数量由XY设定。" = "        For example, an announcement of 24 means that if you discard 2 face cards and put them at the bottom, gate 3 and gate 4 will be the highest and the second highest, and player 4 is the highest. This locks gates 3 and 4; the number of face cards to discard is set by X and Y.";
"        比如报24，表示去掉2张面牌补到底部可保第3门第4门是最大，最大家是4。保34门, 去面牌的数量由XY设定。" = "        For example, an announcement of 24 means that if you discard 2 face cards and put them at the bottom, gate 3 and gate 4 will be the highest, and player 4 is the highest. This locks gates 3 and 4; the number of face cards to discard is set by X and Y.";
"        比如金花:Y设定为 3:报2341,表示发牌方式是 111的情况，第2家最大。 发牌方式是12的情况，第3家最大。发牌方式是 21的情况，第4家最大。 发牌方式是 3的情况，第1家最大拨到中间=拨的最后一张牌做色牌发牌方式由Y参数设定:\nY=2:【11，2】\nY=3:【111,12,21，3】\nY=4:【1111,112,121,13,211,22,31,4】;\nY=5:【1112,113,122,131,14 2111 212,221, 23,311，32，41，5;\nY53:【113,122,131,212,221,311】\nY=54:【11111 1112 1121113,1211122,13114,2111.212221,23,31132.41】\nY=55:【23，32，14，41】" = "        For example, in Flush with Y set to 3: an announcement of 2341 means that if the dealing pattern is 111, player 2 is the highest; if the dealing pattern is 12, player 3 is the highest; if the dealing pattern is 21, player 4 is the highest; and if the dealing pattern is 3, player 1 is the highest. Riffling to the middle means the last riffled card becomes the marked card. The dealing patterns are set by the Y parameter:\nY=2: [11, 2]\nY=3: [111, 12, 21, 3]\nY=4: [1111, 112, 121, 13, 211, 22, 31, 4];\nY=5: [1112, 113, 122, 131, 14, 2111, 212, 221, 23, 311, 32, 41, 5;\nY53: [113, 122, 131, 212, 221, 311]\nY=54: [11111, 1112, 1121, 113, 1211, 122, 131, 14, 2111, 212, 221, 23, 311, 32, 41]\nY=55: [23, 32, 14, 41]";
"        看自己手里的第一张牌。每人先发一张牌，哪家牌点数最大，后续牌从最大家继续发。报哪家最大次大。拿第一张牌的定义为第1家。比如报:1张 21，2张 31，3张 41，4张12.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张21”表示第2家最大，第1家次大.如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张31”表示第3家最大第1家次大。注意:第1轮开始报！" = "        Look at the first card in your own hand. Each player is dealt one card first; whichever player has the highest card value, dealing continues from that player. The app announces which players are the highest and the second highest. The player who takes the first card is defined as player 1. For example, it announces: card 1 21, card 2 31, card 3 41, card 4 12. If your own card was the 1st card dealt, choose \"card 1 21\", which means player 2 is the highest and player 1 is the second highest. If your own card was the 2nd card dealt, choose \"card 2 31\", which means player 3 is the highest and player 1 is the second highest. Note: announcing starts from round 1!";
"        看自己手里的第一张牌，报下轮最大次大家。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。\n        比如报:1张21，2张32，3张41，4张12.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张21”表示下轮第2家最大，第1家次大如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张32”表示下轮第3家最大，第2家次大" = "        Look at the first card in your own hand; the app announces which players will be the highest and the second highest next round. It announces four results; choose the one that matches which card of the deal your own first card was.\n        For example, it announces: card 1 21, card 2 32, card 3 41, card 4 12. If your own card was the 1st card dealt, choose \"card 1 21\", which means player 2 is the highest and player 1 is the second highest next round. If your own card was the 2nd card dealt, choose \"card 2 32\", which means player 3 is the highest and player 2 is the second highest next round";
"        看自己手里的第一张牌，报下轮最大次大家和生死门。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。比如报:1张212，2张 32，3张41，4张12如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张21”表示下轮第2家最大，第1家次大，有活门2如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张32-”表示下轮第3家最大，第2家次大" = "        Look at the first card in your own hand; the app announces which players will be the highest and the second highest next round, plus the live and dead gates. It announces four results; choose the one that matches which card of the deal your own first card was. For example, it announces: card 1 212, card 2 32, card 3 41, card 4 12. If your own card was the 1st card dealt, choose \"card 1 21\", which means player 2 is the highest and player 1 is the second highest next round, with live gate 2. If your own card was the 2nd card dealt, choose \"card 2 32-\", which means player 3 is the highest and player 2 is the second highest next round";
"        看色为色留色。\n        比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报 1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换，可保位置最大\n" = "        Peek to find the mark, treat that card as the marked card and keep it.\n        For example, an announcement of 1,2 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of the 1st dealing round, which locks your position as the highest. An announcement of 1,2;2,3 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards in the 1st round and the 3rd and 4th cards in the 2nd round, which locks your position as the highest\n";
"        设置选连续看底，如果不能看底，设定切牌设置=看手牌。先报最大家，照任意牌，报该牌的后续4张。\n        X=1报单张的点数。\n        X>1 报单张的点数和花色" = "        In Settings choose continuous peek at the bottom card; if you cannot peek at the bottom card, set the cut setting to peek at the hand. The app announces the highest player first; then scan any card and it announces the 4 cards that follow it.\n        X=1: it announces the value of each single card.\n        X>1: it announces both the value and the suit of each single card";
"        说明：在8-1报法的基础上加入看手牌，报 1张 23 活门4 对子 表示照牌是发牌的第一张\n最大次大家为第二家和第三家，有活门4 有对子。以此类推" = "        Note: this adds peeking at the hand on top of the 8-1 announcement method. An announcement of card 1 23 live gate 4 pair means the scanned card is the first card dealt,\nthe highest and second highest players are player 2 and player 3, there is a live gate 4, and there is a pair. The rest follow the same pattern";
"        面牌为色去掉色牌。色牌先发。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最小。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最小" = "        Treat the face card as the mark and discard the marked card. The marked card is dealt first. For example, an announcement of 1,2 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of the 1st dealing round, which locks your position as the lowest. An announcement of 1,2;2,3 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards in the 1st round and the 3rd and 4th cards in the 2nd round. This locks your position as the lowest";
"        面牌为色去掉色牌。色牌先发。比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最大" = "        Treat the face card as the mark and discard the marked card. The marked card is dealt first. For example, an announcement of 1,2 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of the 1st dealing round, which locks your position as the highest. An announcement of 1,2;2,3 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards in the 1st round and the 3rd and 4th cards in the 2nd round. This locks your position as the highest";
"     面牌为色去掉色牌。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最小。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最小" = "     Treat the face card as the mark and discard the marked card. For example, an announcement of 1,2 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of the 1st dealing round, which locks your position as the lowest. An announcement of 1,2;2,3 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards in the 1st round and the 3rd and 4th cards in the 2nd round. This locks your position as the lowest";
"     面牌为色去掉色牌。比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最大" = "     Treat the face card as the mark and discard the marked card. For example, an announcement of 1,2 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of the 1st dealing round, which locks your position as the highest. An announcement of 1,2;2,3 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards in the 1st round and the 3rd and 4th cards in the 2nd round. This locks your position as the highest";
"    底牌为色牌。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最大" = "    The bottom card is the marked card. For example, an announcement of 1,2 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of the 1st dealing round, which locks your position as the highest. An announcement of 1,2;2,3 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards in the 1st round and the 3rd and 4th cards in the 2nd round. This locks your position as the highest";
"    底牌为色牌。比如:报 1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最小。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第 4张交换。可保位置最小" = "    The bottom card is the marked card. For example, an announcement of 1,2 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards of the 1st dealing round, which locks your position as the lowest. An announcement of 1,2;2,3 means you swap the 2nd and 3rd cards in the 1st round and the 3rd and 4th cards in the 2nd round. This locks your position as the lowest";
"    报234:表示去掉2张面牌,可保第1家最小。第3家最大，第4家次大。如果有活门，最后再报活门。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最小。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌。" = "    An announcement of 234 means: discard 2 face cards, and then player 1 is locked as the lowest, player 3 is the highest and player 4 is the second highest. If there is a live gate, it is announced at the end. A 0 in the female voice means your position is already the lowest without discarding anything. A 0 in the male voice means no card meets the condition.";
"    报5:去掉5张面牌，以底牌为色从上开始发牌可保位置最大次大" = "    An announcement of 5 means: discard 5 face cards, then use the bottom card as the mark and deal from the top; this locks your position as the highest and the second highest";
"    报去掉多少张面牌，可保多轮同点且无对子。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1，Y=10。表示在上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能满足条件。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌。如果需要玩4轮，就把连报轮数设定为4。报134=去掉1张面牌。第3轮，第4轮同点且无对子" = "    The app announces how many face cards to discard so that, over several rounds, you have the same points and no pair. The range for discarding face cards is set by the X and Y parameters: the default is X=1,Y=10, which means face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards. Changing it to X=1,Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the first 5 cards. A 0 in the female voice means the condition is already met without discarding anything. A 0 in the male voice means no card meets the condition. If you want to play 4 rounds, set the number of consecutive announced rounds to 4. An announcement of 134 means: discard 1 face card, and then in rounds 3 and 4 you have the same points and no pair";
"    比如报去5 23，表示去掉5张面牌，每轮面牌做色去掉色牌，第2轮，第3轮可保庄最大次大。注意:人定要把连报轮数参数调为2以上2表示在前 2轮中找最大次大，3表示在前3轮中找最大次大" = "    For example, an announcement of discard 5, 23 means: discard 5 face cards, and in each round treat the face card as the mark and discard the marked card; then in rounds 2 and 3 the dealer is locked as the highest and the second highest. Note: you must set the consecutive rounds parameter to 2 or more; 2 means the app looks for the highest and the second highest within the first 2 rounds, and 3 means it looks within the first 3 rounds";
"    游戏说明\n    用牌：\n    大王小王\n    黑桃：10，6，4，8，7，A，3\n    红桃：2，8，4，K，10，7，6，9，5\n    梅花：10，6，4，8，7\n    方片：2，8，4，K，10，7，6，9，5\n    共32张\n    大小：\n    (1) 至尊 （黑桃A + 黑桃3）\n    (2) 对王 > 对红2 > 对红8 > 对红4 > 对黑10=对黑6=对黑4 > 对红K=对红10=对红7=对红6 >\n        对红9=对黑8=对黑7=对红5\n    (3) 天九：大小王 + 9\n    (4) 大小王 + 8 > 2 + 8\n    (5) 大小王 + 7 > 2 + 7 >...同点比较天地人和三长四短\n    A=6点 大小王=2点 K=1点，同点同牌庄家大，零点不分大小\n    天: 大王小王 地：红2 人：红8 和：红4 三长：黑10，黑6，黑4 四短：红K，红10，红7，红6 其余为杂牌" = "    Game rules\n    Cards used:\n    Big Joker and Small Joker\n    Spades: 10, 6, 4, 8, 7, A, 3\n    Hearts: 2, 8, 4, K, 10, 7, 6, 9, 5\n    Clubs: 10, 6, 4, 8, 7\n    Diamonds: 2, 8, 4, K, 10, 7, 6, 9, 5\n    32 cards in total\n    Ranking:\n    (1) Supreme (Ace of Spades + 3 of Spades)\n    (2) A pair of Jokers > a pair of red 2s > a pair of red 8s > a pair of red 4s > a pair of black 10s = a pair of black 6s = a pair of black 4s > a pair of red Ks = a pair of red 10s = a pair of red 7s = a pair of red 6s >\n        a pair of red 9s = a pair of black 8s = a pair of black 7s = a pair of red 5s\n    (3) Tian Jiu: a Joker + a 9\n    (4) A Joker + an 8 > a 2 + an 8\n    (5) A Joker + a 7 > a 2 + a 7 > ... if the points are the same, compare using the Heaven, Earth, Man, Harmony, Three Long and Four Short cards\n    An Ace counts as 6 points, a Joker counts as 2 points and a K counts as 1 point; if the points and the cards are the same, the dealer wins; hands worth zero points are all equal\n    Heaven: Big Joker and Small Joker. Earth: red 2. Man: red 8. Harmony: red 4. Three Long: black 10, black 6, black 4. Four Short: red K, red 10, red 7, red 6. All other cards are miscellaneous cards";
"    用到的牌:36张1-9\n    1.炸弹\n    2.40点:5张牌点数相加为40点以上(包括40点)\n    3.10点:5张牌点数相加为10点以下(包括10点)\n    4.葫芦: 3条加1对\n    5.顺子: 56789最大12345最小\n    6.铁板牛牛:3条加后面2张加起来是0点 (同是铁板牛牛比3条大小)\n    7.铁板牛 3>普通牛3>铁板牛 2>普通牛2\n    8.无牛比最大牌次大牌3大牌\n    9.单张 9>8.....>1" = "    Cards used: 36 cards, 1 to 9\n    1. Bomb\n    2. 40 points: the five cards total 40 points or more\n    3. 10 points: the five cards total 10 points or less\n    4. Full House: three of a kind plus a pair\n    5. Straight: 56789 is the highest and 12345 is the lowest\n    6. Iron Plate Niu Niu: three of a kind, with the other 2 cards adding up to 0 points (if both players have Iron Plate Niu Niu, compare their three of a kind)\n    7. Iron Plate Niu 3 > ordinary Niu 3 > Iron Plate Niu 2 > ordinary Niu 2\n    8. If no one has a Niu, compare the highest card, then the second highest card, then the third highest card\n    9. Single cards: 9 > 8 > ... > 1";
"  看自己手里的第一张牌，报下轮最大家。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。比如报:1张 2，2张 3，3张4，4张1.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张2”表示下轮第2家最大如果自己是发牌的第2张，选“2张3-”表示下轮第3家最大" = "  Look at the first card in your own hand; the app announces which player will be the highest next round. It announces four results; choose the one that matches which card of the deal your own first card was. For example, it announces: card 1 2, card 2 3, card 3 4, card 4 1. If your own card was the 1st card dealt, choose \"card 1 2\", which means player 2 is the highest next round. If your own card was the 2nd card dealt, choose \"card 2 3-\", which means player 3 is the highest next round";
" 任意照牌打色后色牌扔掉保位置最大次大，0=照牌本身打色去色1，上1=照牌上一张打色去色1，下1= 照牌下一张打色去色1。.男声=次小,女声=最小。请设定正确的XY值。X=3,Y=3,表示色牌查找范围上3到下3.如果X=6,Y=0等于掉6张打色去色1保位置最大次大" = " Scan any card, mark it, then throw the marked card away to lock your position as the highest and the second highest. 0 means mark the scanned card itself and remove 1 marked card; up 1 means mark the card above the scanned card and remove 1 marked card; down 1 means mark the card below the scanned card and remove 1 marked card. The male voice means the second lowest and the female voice means the lowest. Please set the correct X and Y values. X=3,Y=3 means the marked card is searched for from 3 cards above to 3 cards below. X=6,Y=0 means discarding 6 cards, then marking and removing 1 marked card to lock your position as the highest and the second highest";
"0最大，9次大，1最小" = "0 is the highest, 9 the second highest, 1 the lowest";
"0点最大，1点最小" = "0 points is the highest, 1 point is the lowest";
"1)用牌数，黑桃A，2个红2，黑桃3，红桃3，4个4，2个红5，4个6，4个7，4个8，2个红9，4个10，俩个红 J，俩个红Q，大王，一共34张牌，每家发2张牌\n牌型大小顺序:对红Q>对红2>大王+黑桃 3>对红8>红桃3+红8>红5+大王>对红4>红3+黑8>对黑10(=对黑6=对黑4)>对红10(=对红J=对红7=对红6)>对红9(=对红5=对黑8=对黑7)>红\nQ+红9>红2+红9>红Q+8>红2+8>红 Q+7>红2+7>红8+红J\n接下来比点数，(Q=2点，J=1点，黑桃 A=6点，大王=6点)点数相同时比最大的牌。红Q>红2>红8>红4>红6(=红10=黑4)>红J(=黑10=红7=黑6)>红9(=黑8=黑7=红5=大王=黑桃A=黑桃3-红桃3)最大牌相同时庄家赢,同是0点一样的，黑桃3+红桃3=6点，大王+黑桃A=2点" = "1) Cards used: the Ace of Spades, two red 2s, the 3 of Spades, the 3 of Hearts, four 4s, two red 5s, four 6s, four 7s, four 8s, two red 9s, four 10s, two red Js, two red Qs and the Big Joker, 34 cards in total; each player is dealt 2 cards\nHand ranking: a pair of red Qs > a pair of red 2s > Big Joker + 3 of Spades > a pair of red 8s > 3 of Hearts + red 8 > red 5 + Big Joker > a pair of red 4s > red 3 + black 8 > a pair of black 10s (= a pair of black 6s = a pair of black 4s) > a pair of red 10s (= a pair of red Js = a pair of red 7s = a pair of red 6s) > a pair of red 9s (= a pair of red 5s = a pair of black 8s = a pair of black 7s) > red\nQ + red 9 > red 2 + red 9 > red Q + 8 > red 2 + 8 > red Q + 7 > red 2 + 7 > red 8 + red J\nNext compare the points (a Q counts as 2 points, a J as 1 point, the Ace of Spades as 6 points and the Big Joker as 6 points); if the points are the same, compare the highest card: red Q > red 2 > red 8 > red 4 > red 6 (= red 10 = black 4) > red J (= black 10 = red 7 = black 6) > red 9 (= black 8 = black 7 = red 5 = Big Joker = Ace of Spades = 3 of Spades = 3 of Hearts). If the highest cards are also the same, the dealer wins, and two hands both worth 0 points are equal. The 3 of Spades + the 3 of Hearts is 6 points, and the Big Joker + the Ace of Spades is 2 points";
"1-10 四个J\nJJ最大...AA最小，J算0点，10点最大...1点最小，同点庄家大。" = "1-10 plus four Js\nA pair of Js is the highest and a pair of Aces is the lowest. A J counts as 0 points; 10 points is the highest and 1 point is the lowest; if the points are the same, the dealer wins.";
"1-10 四个K\nKK最大...AA最小，K算0点，10点最大...1点最小，同点庄家大!" = "1-10 plus four Ks\nA pair of Ks is the highest and a pair of Aces is the lowest. A K counts as 0 points; 10 points is the highest and 1 point is the lowest; if the points are the same, the dealer wins!";
