"40张斗牛 同点一样大用到的牌:123456789J J算一点 1=J\n1)炸弹:9999>8888··>1111=JJJJ 1和J可代替组合为炸弹炸弹相同比最后一张牌\n2)5小:五张牌相加，总点数在10以内包括10，总点数越小牌越大如1111J>11223>11233\n3)牛牛:5张相加总数为10的倍数算牛牛。三同牛牛。普通牛牛。\n同为牛牛时5张相加比总点数，总点数越小越大\n4)牛9>牛8>···>牛1:3同牛，普通牛。同点一样大，不比单张，不比花色\n5)无牛:无牛一样大" = "Dou Niu with 40 cards; hands with the same points are equal. Cards used: 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9 J. A J counts as 1 point, so 1 = J\n1) Bomb: 9999 > 8888 > ... > 1111 = JJJJ. A 1 and a J can stand in for each other when forming a bomb. If two bombs are the same, compare the last card\n2) Five Small: the five cards added together total 10 points or less; the lower the total, the better the hand, for example 1111J > 11223 > 11233\n3) Niu Niu: if the five cards total a multiple of 10, the hand counts as Niu Niu. This covers three-of-a-kind Niu Niu and ordinary Niu Niu.\nWhen both players have Niu Niu, compare the totals of their five cards; the lower the total, the better the hand\n4) Niu 9 > Niu 8 > ... > Niu 1, for both three-of-a-kind Niu and ordinary Niu. Hands with the same points are equal; single cards and suits are not compared\n5) No Niu: all hands with no Niu are equal";
