"52张牌，每人13张\n1.清顺 >炸弹>3带2>清一色>顺子>3不带>2对>1对\n2.保总道数最大\n3.翻倍规则：头道三条3倍；中道葫芦3倍，炸弹5倍，同花顺6倍；尾道炸弹5倍，同花顺6倍；赢同一家三道再全部翻倍，上限24。" = "52 cards, 13 per player\n1. Straight Flush > Bomb > three plus two > Flush > Straight > bare three of a kind > Two Pair > Pair\n2. Aim to win the greatest total number of rows\n3. Multiplier rules: three of a kind in the front row pays 3x; in the middle row a Full House pays 3x, a Bomb 5x and a Straight Flush 6x; in the bottom row a Bomb pays 5x and a Straight Flush 6x; if you beat the same player in all three rows, everything is doubled again, up to a cap of 24.";
