"X=要报的第一张牌的位置。\n人数=要报的扑克张数。\n位置=报的2张牌之间的间隔\nY=10:报单张点数\nY>10:报单张点数+花色\n比如X=1 人数=4 位置=4 Y=10:报1 5 9 13张点数。\n比如X=2 人数=5 位置=1 Y11:报23456张点数+花色\n支持报底4张:发牌方式设定为反发。X=1 人数=4 位置=1 Y=10\n照任意牌，报照的牌后面的几张。报几张由人数参数设定，在设置中需要选择连续照底。" = "X = the position of the first card to announce.\nPlayers = how many cards to announce.\nPosition = the gap between the two cards that are announced\nY=10: announce the rank of each single card\nY>10: announce the rank of each single card plus its suit\nFor example, X=1, Players=4, Position=4, Y=10: announce the ranks of cards 1, 5, 9 and 13.\nFor example, X=2, Players=5, Position=1, Y=11: announce the ranks and suits of cards 2, 3, 4, 5 and 6.\nIt can also announce the bottom 4 cards: set the deal mode to reverse deal, then X=1, Players=4, Position=1, Y=10\nSpot any card and it announces the cards that follow it. The Players parameter sets how many cards are announced, and in Settings you must choose continuous bottom spotting.";
"X=要报的第一张牌的位置。\n人数=要报的扑克张数。\n位置=报的2张牌之间的间隔\nY=10:报单张点数\nY>10:报单张点数+花色\n比如X=1 人数=4 位置=4 Y=10:报1 5 9 13张点数。\n比如X=2 人数=5 位置=1 Y11:报23456张点数+花色\n支持报底4张:发牌方式设定为反发。X=1 人数=4 位置=1 Y=10\n照任意牌，报照的牌后面的几张。报几张由人数参数设定，在设置中需要选择连续照底。\n        " = "X = the position of the first card to announce.\nPlayers = how many cards to announce.\nPosition = the gap between the two cards that are announced\nY=10: announce the rank of each single card\nY>10: announce the rank of each single card plus its suit\nFor example, X=1, Players=4, Position=4, Y=10: announce the ranks of cards 1, 5, 9 and 13.\nFor example, X=2, Players=5, Position=1, Y=11: announce the ranks and suits of cards 2, 3, 4, 5 and 6.\nIt can also announce the bottom 4 cards: set the deal mode to reverse deal, then X=1, Players=4, Position=1, Y=10\nSpot any card and it announces the cards that follow it. The Players parameter sets how many cards are announced, and in Settings you must choose continuous bottom spotting.\n        ";
