"不需要自定义发牌\n52张牌，不要大小王，每人先发2张牌，再一次发3张1张1张公共牌，然后每次发公共牌之前都要烧一张牌。\n先比牌型，再比主要部分牌大小，不分花色。\n同花顺\n四条\n葫芦，三条带一对\n同花\n顺子\n三条\n两对\n一对\n高牌" = "No custom deal is needed.\nUse 52 cards with no Jokers. Each player is dealt 2 cards first, then the community cards come out 3 at a time, then 1, then 1, and a card is burned before each round of community cards.\nCompare the hand type first, then the ranks of the cards that make up the hand; suits do not matter.\nStraight Flush\nFour of a Kind\nFull House, three of a kind plus a pair\nFlush\nStraight\nThree of a Kind\nTwo Pair\nPair\nHigh Card";
"不需要自定义发牌\n使用一副去掉 2、3、4和5的牌，共36张牌。\n短牌皇家同花顺：A-6-7-8-9 的同花顺。\n短牌同花顺：任意五张同花的连续牌。\n四条：四张相同的牌。\n满堂红：三张相同的牌加上一对。\n短牌同花：五张同花但非连续的牌。\n短牌顺子：A-6-7-8-9 或更高的五张连续牌。\n三条：三张相同的牌。\n两对：两对不同的牌。\n一对：两张相同的牌。\n高牌：没有其他组合时，最大的牌。" = "No custom deal is needed.\nUse a deck with the 2s, 3s, 4s and 5s removed, 36 cards in total.\nShort-deck Royal Flush: a straight flush of A-6-7-8-9.\nShort-deck Straight Flush: any five consecutive cards of the same suit.\nFour of a Kind: four cards of the same rank.\nFull House: three cards of the same rank plus a pair.\nShort-deck Flush: five cards of the same suit that are not consecutive.\nShort-deck Straight: five consecutive cards, A-6-7-8-9 or higher.\nThree of a Kind: three cards of the same rank.\nTwo Pair: two different pairs.\nPair: two cards of the same rank.\nHigh Card: when there is no other combination, the highest card plays.";
