"任意对子+大王或小王+KKK+QQQ+JJJ" = "Any pair + Big Joker or Small Joker + KKK + QQQ + JJJ";
"任意照牌打國后放回原处保位置最小次小，0=招牌本身打色留色，上1=照牌上一张打色留色，下1=照牌不一张打色留色。男声=次大，女声=最大。请设定正确的XY值。X=3,Y=3,表示色牌查找范围上3到下3.如果X=6,Y=6等于掉6张打色留色保位置最小次小" = "Spot any card, mark it, then put it back where it was to lock the lowest and second lowest positions. 0 = mark the spotted card itself and keep it marked; Up 1 = mark the card one above the spotted card and keep it marked; Down 1 = mark the card one below the spotted card and keep it marked. A male voice announces the second highest and a female voice announces the highest. Please set the correct X and Y values. X=3, Y=3 means the marked card is searched for from 3 cards above to 3 cards below. If X=6, Y=6, that means dropping 6 cards, marking one and keeping it marked to lock the lowest and second lowest positions.";
"任意照牌打色后放回原处保位置最大次大，0照牌本身打色留色,上1=照牌上一张打色留色，下1=照牌不一张打色留色。男声=次大，女声=最大。请设定正确的XY值。X=3,Y=3,表示色牌查找范围上3到下3.如果X=6,Y=6等于掉6张打色留色保位置最大次大" = "Spot any card, mark it, then put it back where it was to lock the highest and second highest positions. 0 = mark the spotted card itself and keep it marked; Up 1 = mark the card one above the spotted card and keep it marked; Down 1 = mark the card one below the spotted card and keep it marked. A male voice announces the second highest and a female voice announces the highest. Please set the correct X and Y values. X=3, Y=3 means the marked card is searched for from 3 cards above to 3 cards below. If X=6, Y=6, that means dropping 6 cards, marking one and keeping it marked to lock the highest and second highest positions.";
"任意照牌打色后色牌先发保位置最大次大，0=照牌本身打色,上1=照牌上一张打色，下1=照牌下一张打色.男声=次大，女声=最大。请设定正确的XY值。X=3,Y=3,表示色牌查找范围上3到下 3.如果X=6,Y=0等于 掉6张打色色先发保位置最大次大\n                " = "Spot any card, mark it, then deal the marked card first to lock the highest and second highest positions. 0 = mark the spotted card itself; Up 1 = mark the card one above the spotted card; Down 1 = mark the card one below the spotted card. A male voice announces the second highest and a female voice announces the highest. Please set the correct X and Y values. X=3, Y=3 means the marked card is searched for from 3 cards above to 3 cards below. If X=6, Y=0, that means dropping 6 cards, marking one and dealing the marked card first to lock the highest and second highest positions.\n                ";
"任意照牌打色后色牌先发保位置最小次小，0=照牌本身打色,上1=照牌上一张打色，下1=照牌下一张打色.男声=次大，女声=最大。请设定正确的XY值。X=3,Y=3,表示色牌查找范围上3到下 3.如果X=6,Y=0等于 掉6张打色色先发保位置最小次小" = "Spot any card, mark it, then deal the marked card first to lock the lowest and second lowest positions. 0 = mark the spotted card itself; Up 1 = mark the card one above the spotted card; Down 1 = mark the card one below the spotted card. A male voice announces the second highest and a female voice announces the highest. Please set the correct X and Y values. X=3, Y=3 means the marked card is searched for from 3 cards above to 3 cards below. If X=6, Y=0, that means dropping 6 cards, marking one and dealing the marked card first to lock the lowest and second lowest positions.";
"任意照牌打色后色牌扔掉保位置最小次小，0照牌本身打色去色1,上1=照牌上一张打色去色1，下1= 照牌下一张打色去色1。.男声=次小,女声=最小。请设定正确的XY值。X=3,Y=3,表示色牌查找范围上3到下3.如果X=6,Y=0等于掉6张打色去色1保位置最小次小" = "Spot any card, mark it, then throw the marked card away to lock the lowest and second lowest positions. 0 = mark the spotted card itself and remove 1 marked card; Up 1 = mark the card one above the spotted card and remove 1 marked card; Down 1 = mark the card one below the spotted card and remove 1 marked card. A male voice announces the second lowest and a female voice announces the lowest. Please set the correct X and Y values. X=3, Y=3 means the marked card is searched for from 3 cards above to 3 cards below. If X=6, Y=0, that means dropping 6 cards, marking one and removing 1 marked card to lock the lowest and second lowest positions.";
"任意照牌牌切到底部。保位置最大次大，0=照牌本身打色去色全部，上1=照牌上一张打色去色全部，下1=照牌下一张打色去色全部.男声=次大，女声=最大。 请设定正确的XY值。X=3,Y=3,表示色牌查找范围上3到下3.如果X=6,Y=0等于掉6张打色去色全部保位置最大次大" = "Spot any card and cut it to the bottom. This locks the highest and second highest positions. 0 = mark the spotted card itself and remove all marked cards; Up 1 = mark the card one above the spotted card and remove all marked cards; Down 1 = mark the card one below the spotted card and remove all marked cards. A male voice announces the second highest and a female voice announces the highest. Please set the correct X and Y values. X=3, Y=3 means the marked card is searched for from 3 cards above to 3 cards below. If X=6, Y=0, that means dropping 6 cards, marking one and removing all marked cards to lock the highest and second highest positions.";
"任意照牌牌切到底部。保位置最小次小，0=照牌本身打色去色全部，上1=照牌上一张打色去色全部，下1=照牌下一张打色去色全部,男声=次小女声=最小。请设定正确的XY值，X=3,Y-3,表示色牌查找范围上3到下3.如果X=6,Y-0等于掉6张打色去色全部保位置最小次小" = "Spot any card and cut it to the bottom. This locks the lowest and second lowest positions. 0 = mark the spotted card itself and remove all marked cards; Up 1 = mark the card one above the spotted card and remove all marked cards; Down 1 = mark the card one below the spotted card and remove all marked cards. A male voice announces the second lowest and a female voice announces the lowest. Please set the correct X and Y values. X=3, Y=3 means the marked card is searched for from 3 cards above to 3 cards below. If X=6, Y=0, that means dropping 6 cards, marking one and removing all marked cards to lock the lowest and second lowest positions.";
