"去掉1张再洗牌，上10张中抽一张牌出来，抽出的牌+洗牌前去掉的牌相加做色点。点数大于10 要去10，比如 10+5=15点，色点为15-10=5点" = "Discard 1 card and then shuffle. Draw one card out of the top 10, and add that card to the card discarded before the shuffle to get the mark point. If the total is more than 10, subtract 10: for example, 10+5=15 points, so the mark point is 15-10=5 points";
"去掉多少张牌由参数Y设定。默认Y=10,请修改为 Y=14." = "Parameter Y sets how many cards are discarded. The default is Y=10; please change it to Y=14.";
"去掉多少张牌由参数Y设定。默认Y=10,请修改为 Y=14.\n" = "Parameter Y sets how many cards are discarded. The default is Y=10; please change it to Y=14.\n";
"去掉多少张牌由参数Y设定。默认Y=10,请修改为 Y=14.去掉14张牌后，如果第14张是2点，那么再去掉2张面牌，报哪家最小" = "Parameter Y sets how many cards are discarded. The default is Y=10; please change it to Y=14. After discarding 14 cards, if the 14th card is worth 2 points, discard 2 more cards from the top, then announce which player is lowest";
"去掉多少张牌由参数Y设定。默认Y=10,请修改为 Y=14、\n" = "Parameter Y sets how many cards are discarded. The default is Y=10; please change it to Y=14.\n";
"去掉多少张牌由参数Y设定。默认Y=10,请修改为Y=14.去掉14张牌后，如果第14张是2点,那么再去掉2张面牌，报哪家最大\n" = "Parameter Y sets how many cards are discarded. The default is Y=10; please change it to Y=14. After discarding 14 cards, if the 14th card is worth 2 points, discard 2 more cards from the top, then announce which player is highest\n";
"去掉色牌本报15,19=第15张到19张都可用来打色，可保位置最小。打色范围可由XY参数修改，默认是X = 1，Y = 10,一般修改为X=1.Y=54,整幅牌里面查找打色牌" = "Discard the marked card itself. An announcement of 15, 19 means that any card from the 15th to the 19th can be used as the marked card, which locks the lowest position. The X and Y parameters set the marking range; the default is X=1, Y=10, and it is usually changed to X=1, Y=54 so that the whole deck is searched for a card to mark.";
"去掉色牌本身。报 15,19 =第15张到19张都可用来打色，可保位置最大次大。打色范围可由XY参数修改，默认是X=1，Y=10,一般修改为X=1.Y=54,整幅牌里面查找打色牌" = "Discard the marked card itself. An announcement of 15, 19 means that any card from the 15th to the 19th can be used as the marked card, which locks the highest and second highest position. The X and Y parameters set the marking range; the default is X=1, Y=10, and it is usually changed to X=1, Y=54 so that the whole deck is searched for a card to mark.";
"去掉色牌本身。报 15,19=第15张到19张都可用来打色，可保位置最大。打色范围可由XY参数修改，默认是X=1，Y=10,一般修改为X-1.Y=54,整幅牌里面查找打色牌" = "Discard the marked card itself. An announcement of 15, 19 means that any card from the 15th to the 19th can be used as the marked card, which locks the highest position. The X and Y parameters set the marking range; the default is X=1, Y=10, and it is usually changed to X=1, Y=54 so that the whole deck is searched for a card to mark.";
"去掉色牌本身。报 15,19=第15张到19张都可用来打色，可保位置最小次小。打色范围可由XY参数修改，默认是X=1,Y=10,一般修改为X=1.Y=54 整幅牌里面查找打色牌" = "Discard the marked card itself. An announcement of 15, 19 means that any card from the 15th to the 19th can be used as the marked card, which locks the lowest and second lowest position. The X and Y parameters set the marking range; the default is X=1, Y=10, and it is usually changed to X=1, Y=54 so that the whole deck is searched for a card to mark.";
"去掉面牌和底牌，两张牌相加的点数为几点，就去掉面上几张牌，报出最大次大.\n注意 10点以上取个位数，比如两张牌相加为13点，只需去3张牌。比如 面牌 J,底牌=Q, J+Q=23点，23-20=3点，去掉3张牌。\n有对子或同点用男声报如果最大家同点需要报最大两家和次大" = "Discard the top card and the bottom card, add their points together, and discard that many cards from the top, then announce the highest and second highest.\nNote: if the total is 10 or more, take only the last digit. For example, if the two cards add up to 13 points, you only discard 3 cards. If the top card is J and the bottom card is Q, then J+Q=23 points, 23-20=3 points, so discard 3 cards.\nIf there is a pair or a tie, a male voice makes the announcement. If the highest players are tied, announce both tied players and the second highest";
