"又名【切牌为色报最大】:照色牌，去掉色牌和色牌上面部分。报哪家最大。Y=1:色牌和色牌上部分的牌补到底部。Y>1色牌和色牌上部分的牌不补到底部。" = "Also called [Cut to Mark, Announce Highest]: spot the marked card, then discard the marked card and everything above it, and announce which player is highest. Y=1: the marked card and the cards above it are moved to the bottom. Y>1: the marked card and the cards above it are not moved to the bottom.";
"又名【切牌为色报最大次大】:照色牌，去掉色牌和色牌上面部分。报哪家最大。Y=1:色牌和色牌上部分的牌补到底部。Y>1色牌和色牌上部分的牌不补到底部。" = "Also called [Cut to Mark, Announce Highest and Second Highest]: spot the marked card, then discard the marked card and everything above it, and announce which player is highest. Y=1: the marked card and the cards above it are moved to the bottom. Y>1: the marked card and the cards above it are not moved to the bottom.";
"又名【切牌为色报最小】:照色牌，去掉色牌和色牌上面部分。报哪家最大。Y1:色牌和色牌上部分的牌补到底部。Y>1色牌和色牌上部分的牌不补到底部。" = "Also called [Cut to Mark, Announce Lowest]: spot the marked card, then discard the marked card and everything above it, and announce which player is highest. Y=1: the marked card and the cards above it are moved to the bottom. Y>1: the marked card and the cards above it are not moved to the bottom.";
"又名【切牌为色报最小次小】:照色牌，去掉色牌和色牌上面部分。报哪家最大。Y=1:色牌和色牌上部分的牌补到底部。Y>1色牌和色牌上部分的牌不补到底部。" = "Also called [Cut to Mark, Announce Lowest and Second Lowest]: spot the marked card, then discard the marked card and everything above it, and announce which player is highest. Y=1: the marked card and the cards above it are moved to the bottom. Y>1: the marked card and the cards above it are not moved to the bottom.";
"又名【切牌为色报最排名】:照色牌，去掉色牌和色牌止面部分。报哪家最大。Y1:色牌和色牌上部分的牌补到底部。Y>1色牌和色牌上部分的牌不补到底部。" = "Also called [Cut to Mark, Announce Ranking]: spot the marked card, then discard the marked card and everything above it, and announce which player is highest. Y=1: the marked card and the cards above it are moved to the bottom. Y>1: the marked card and the cards above it are not moved to the bottom.";
