"发牌方式由Y参数设定:\nY=2:【11，2】\nY=3:【111,12,21，3】\nY=4:【1111,112,121,13,211,22,31,4】;\nY=5:【1112,113,122,131,14 2111 212,221, 23,311，32，41，5;\nY53:【113,122,131,212,221,311】\n\n比如斗牛:Y设定为5，报 122，按照122方式发牌，可保位置最大次大\n        \n        " = "Parameter Y sets the dealing pattern:\nY=2: [11, 2]\nY=3: [111, 12, 21, 3]\nY=4: [1111, 112, 121, 13, 211, 22, 31, 4];\nY=5: [1112, 113, 122, 131, 14 2111 212, 221, 23, 311, 32, 41, 5;\nY53: [113, 122, 131, 212, 221, 311]\n\nFor example, in Dou Niu set Y=5; if it announces 122, deal in the 122 pattern to lock the highest and second highest positions\n        \n        ";
"发牌方式由Y参数设定:\nY=2:【11，2】\nY=3:【111,12,21，3】\nY=4:【1111,112,121,13,211,22,31,4】;\nY=5:【1112,113,122,131,14 2111 212,221, 23,311，32，41，5;\nY53:【113,122,131,212,221,311】\nY=54:【11111 1112 1121113,1211122,13114,2111.212221,23,31132.41】\nY=55:【23，32，14，41】\n报32=第1轮发3张，第2轮发2张注意:请选择正确的色点设置，比如 底2张为 10 和5，相加点数和=10+5=15，最终色点数=15-10=5点" = "Parameter Y sets the dealing pattern:\nY=2: [11, 2]\nY=3: [111, 12, 21, 3]\nY=4: [1111, 112, 121, 13, 211, 22, 31, 4];\nY=5: [1112, 113, 122, 131, 14 2111 212, 221, 23, 311, 32, 41, 5;\nY53: [113, 122, 131, 212, 221, 311]\nY=54: [11111 1112 1121113, 1211122, 13114, 2111.212221, 23, 31132.41]\nY=55: [23, 32, 14, 41]\nAn announcement of 32 means dealing 3 cards in the 1st round and 2 cards in the 2nd round. Note: please choose the correct mark point setting. For example, if the bottom 2 cards are 10 and 5, their total is 10+5=15, so the final mark point is 15-10=5 points";
