"扑克张数54张牌\n1:两黑或者两红算对子，\n2:对子一黑一红算点数，对子一样大不分大小，四张分头尾\n3:对王>王+9>对A>对k>.....对2.\n4:王+8> A+8> k+8>......0.同点庄赢\nJQK王=1同点比最大牌" = "Deck: 54 cards\n1: Two black cards or two red cards count as a pair,\n2: A pair made of one black and one red counts as points instead; all pairs are equal in rank; with four cards, split them into a front hand and a rear hand\n3: A pair of Jokers > Joker+9 > a pair of Aces > a pair of Ks > ..... a pair of 2s.\n4: Joker+8 > A+8 > K+8 > ...... 0. If the points are tied, the dealer wins\nJ, Q, K and Jokers each count as 1 point; if the points are tied, compare the highest card";
