"扑克张数:54张，52张，48张\n1) 最大: 3个公组台:KKK>QQQ >JJJ\n2) 次大:三个混合公(任意JQK王)同是混公比最大牌\n3)无三公混公比点数(点数是指三张牌点数相加的总点数取个位数的值)，9最大，0最小(王,K、Q、J、10为0点)\n4)无三公混公比点数，同点的情况下比公数，例如:双公9点>单公9点。A也算公，但是AKQ又不算混公)\n5)无三公混公比点数，同点同公数的情况下比最大牌。A最大K次大，2最小" = "Deck: 54, 52 or 48 cards\n1) Highest: three face cards of the same rank together: KKK > QQQ > JJJ\n2) Second highest: three mixed face cards (any of J, Q, K or a Joker); if both hands are a Mixed Gong, compare the highest card\n3) If neither hand has San Gong or a Mixed Gong, compare points (the points are the last digit of the sum of the three cards); 9 is the highest and 0 is the lowest (a Joker, K, Q, J and 10 each count as 0 points)\n4) When points are compared and the points are the same, compare how many face cards each hand holds, for example two face cards with 9 points beat one face card with 9 points. An A also counts as a face card, but A-K-Q does not count as a Mixed Gong)\n5) When points are compared and both the points and the number of face cards are the same, compare the highest card. A is the highest, K is second highest and 2 is the lowest";
"扑克张数:54张，52张，48张\n1) 最大:三个混合公(任意JQK王)同是混公比最大牌。单张先比大小，同大比花色。大王>小王>K>...>2>A,方片>红心>梅花>黑桃\n2) 无混公比点数(所谓点数是指三张牌点数相加的总点数取个位数的值)，0点大，9点次大，1点最小。(王，K，Q， J，10为0点)\n3) 无混公比点数，同点情况下比最大牌。单张先比大小，同大比花色。大王>小王>K>...>2>A,方片>红心>梅花>黑桃" = "Deck: 54, 52 or 48 cards\n1) Highest: three mixed face cards (any of J, Q, K or a Joker); if both hands are a Mixed Gong, compare the highest card. Compare the card ranks first, and if they are equal compare the suits. Big Joker > Small Joker > K > ... > 2 > A, Diamonds > Hearts > Clubs > Spades\n2) If neither hand has a Mixed Gong, compare points (the points are the last digit of the sum of the three cards); 0 points is the highest, 9 points is second highest and 1 point is the lowest. (a Joker, K, Q, J and 10 each count as 0 points)\n3) When points are compared and the points are the same, compare the highest card. Compare the card ranks first, and if they are equal compare the suits. Big Joker > Small Joker > K > ... > 2 > A, Diamonds > Hearts > Clubs > Spades";
"扑克张数:54张，52张，48张\n1) 最大:三个混合公(任意JQK王)同是混公比最大牌。单张先比大小，同大比花色。大王>小王>K>...>2>A,黑桃>红心>梅花>方片\n2) 无混公比点数(所谓点数是指三张牌点数相加的总点数取个位数的值)，0点大，9点次大，1点最小。(王，K，Q， J，10为0点)\n3)无混公比点数，同点情况下比最大牌。单张先比大小，同大比花色。大王>小王>K>...>2>A,黑桃>红心>梅花>方片" = "Number of cards: 54, 52, or 48\n1) Highest: three mixed face cards (any J, Q, K, or Joker). When both hands are mixed face cards, compare the highest card. For a single card, compare rank first; if the rank is the same, compare suit. Big Joker > Small Joker > K > ... > 2 > A, Spades > Hearts > Clubs > Diamonds\n2) With no mixed face cards, compare points (points means the sum of the three cards' points, taking the ones digit). 0 points is highest, 9 is second, 1 is lowest. (Joker, K, Q, J, 10 count as 0 points)\n3) With no mixed face cards, compare points; if the points are the same, compare the highest card. For a single card, compare rank first; if the rank is the same, compare suit. Big Joker > Small Joker > K > ... > 2 > A, Spades > Hearts > Clubs > Diamonds";
