"报 15 18，表示在第15张或16张或17张或18张处切牌，可保位置最大次大。请把打色范围Y修改为 54." = "An announcement of 15 18 means cut at card 15, 16, 17, or 18; it can lock the highest and second-highest positions. Please change the mark range Y to 54.";
"报 15 18，表示在第15张或16张或17张或18张处切牌，可保位置最小次小。请把打色范围Y修改为 54." = "An announcement of 15 18 means cut at card 15, 16, 17, or 18; it can lock the lowest and second-lowest positions. Please change the mark range Y to 54.";
"报 15,19=第15张到19张都可用来打色，可保位置最大。打色范围可由XY参数修改，默认是X=1,Y=10,一般修改为X=1.Y=54,整幅牌里面查找打色牌" = "An announcement of 15,19 means cards 15 through 19 can all be used for marking; it can lock the highest position. The mark range can be changed with the X and Y parameters; the default is X=1, Y=10, and it is usually changed to X=1, Y=54 to search the whole deck for cards to mark";
"报 15,19=第15张到19张都可用来打色，可保位置最大次大。打色范围可由XY参数修改，默认是X=1，Y=10,一般修改为X=1.Y=54,整幅牌里面查找打色牌" = "An announcement of 15,19 means cards 15 through 19 can all be used for marking; it can lock the highest and second-highest positions. The mark range can be changed with the X and Y parameters; the default is X=1, Y=10, and it is usually changed to X=1, Y=54 to search the whole deck for cards to mark";
"报 15,19=第15张到19张都可用来打色，可保位置最小。打色范围可由XY参数修改，默认是X=1,Y=10,一般修改为X=1.Y=54,整幅牌里面查找打色牌" = "An announcement of 15,19 means cards 15 through 19 can all be used for marking; it can lock the lowest position. The mark range can be changed with the X and Y parameters; the default is X=1, Y=10, and it is usually changed to X=1, Y=54 to search the whole deck for cards to mark";
"报1大2大3大" = "Announces 1 highest, 2 highest, 3 highest";
"报3、6张，5、3张=当前段位中位置3有6张牌满足，位置5有3张牌满足。X=段位开始位置，位置=要报的段位。固定10张牌为1个段位" = "An announcement of 3, 6 cards and 5, 3 cards means that in the current tier, position 3 has 6 matching cards and position 5 has 3 matching cards. X = the tier's starting position; position = the tier to announce. Each tier is fixed at 10 cards";
"报3，表示把前3张面牌一张一张地抽到底部，不是一次去3张。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌" = "An announcement of 3 means drawing the top 3 face cards to the bottom one at a time, not removing 3 at once. Female voice 0 = the highest position is locked without discarding any cards. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition";
"报3，表示把前3张面牌一张一张地抽到底部，不是一次去3张。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最小。男声找不到满足条件的牌" = "An announcement of 3 means drawing the top 3 face cards to the bottom one at a time, not removing 3 at once. Female voice 0 = the lowest position is locked without discarding any cards. Male voice = no card meets the condition";
"报52，表示去掉5张面牌，至少有一玩家是牛牛。第2家是牛牛" = "An announcement of 52 means discarding 5 face cards, and at least one player has Niu Niu. Player 2 has Niu Niu";
"报5: 倒数第5张牌打色留色，面牌移动到色牌下面，可保位置最大" = "An announcement of 5: mark and keep the 5th card from the bottom; the face cards move below the marked card; it can lock the highest position";
"报5:去掉5张面牌，以面牌为色色牌先发，从上开始发牌可保位置最大" = "An announcement of 5: discard 5 face cards; the face card becomes the marked card and marked cards are dealt first; dealing from the top, it can lock the highest position";
"报5:去掉5张面牌，以面牌为色色牌先发，从上开始发牌可保位置最大次大" = "An announcement of 5: discard 5 face cards; the face card becomes the marked card and marked cards are dealt first; dealing from the top, it can lock the highest and second-highest positions";
"报5:去掉5张面牌，以面牌为色色牌先发，从上开始发牌可保位置最小" = "An announcement of 5: discard 5 face cards; the face card becomes the marked card and marked cards are dealt first; dealing from the top, it can lock the lowest position";
"报5，如果第5张点数是6点，发牌第1轮发6张，第2轮发10张。既根据色牌点数确定第轮发几张。" = "An announcement of 5: if the 5th card is worth 6 points, deal 6 cards in round 1 and 10 cards in round 2. That is, the marked card's points determine how many cards are dealt each round.";
"报5，表示去掉5张面牌，可保没有牛或最多一家有牛.女=无牛。男=1家有牛。0=不去牌，特殊:位置=2:保无牛或最多2家有牛" = "An announcement of 5 means discarding 5 face cards; it can ensure that no one has Niu or at most one player has Niu. Female = no Niu. Male = 1 player has Niu. 0 = no cards discarded. Special: position = 2 means ensuring no Niu or at most 2 players have Niu";
"报下一轮" = "Announce the next round";
"报下家大于9的牌, 910JQKA2，Y=9, 报大于9的牌。Y=10,报大于10的牌, Y=3, 报全部牌" = "Announces the next player's cards higher than 9: 9 10 J Q K A 2. Y=9 announces cards higher than 9. Y=10 announces cards higher than 10. Y=3 announces all cards";
"报切几张目标位置最大" = "Announce how many cards to cut so that the target position gets the highest hand";
"报切几张目标位置最小" = "Announce how many cards to cut so that the target position gets the lowest hand";
"报去掉多少张面牌，可保位置最大次大。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1，Y=10。表示在上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌" = "Announces how many face cards to discard; it can lock the highest and second-highest positions. The range for discarding face cards is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=1, Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the top 5 cards. Female voice 0 = the highest position is locked without discarding any cards. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition";
"报去掉多少张面牌，可保位置最小。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌。 修改为:X=1,Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最小。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌" = "Announces how many face cards to discard; it can lock the lowest position. The range for discarding face cards is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=1, Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the top 5 cards. Female voice 0 = the lowest position is locked without discarding any cards. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition";
"报去掉多少张面牌，可保位置最小次小。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1，Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最小次小。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌" = "Announces how many face cards to discard; it can lock the lowest and second-lowest positions. The range for discarding face cards is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=1, Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the top 5 cards. Female voice 0 = the lowest and second-lowest positions are locked without discarding any cards. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition";
"报去掉多少张面牌，可保保多轮同点。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。有活门=女声。平点=男声，半活门=男声，无对子优先.\n每轮报当轮的最大次大生死门，照牌报下一轮最大次大生死门。保多轮轮数需要用连报轮数设置，比如设置连报轮数为4，就是保4轮同点最多。" = "Announces how many face cards to discard; it can secure the same points across multiple rounds. The range for discarding face cards is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=1, Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the top 5 cards. Live gate = female voice. Tie = male voice, half-live gate = male voice, no pair takes priority.\nEach round announces that round's highest and second-highest live/dead gate; following the cards, it announces the next round's highest and second-highest live/dead gate. The number of rounds to secure is set with the consecutive-round setting; for example, setting the consecutive-round count to 4 secures the same points for at most 4 rounds.";
"报去掉多少张面牌，可保多轮位置最大次数最多。去面牌范围由参数X Y设定:默认X=1,Y=10. 表示在上10张内去掉面牌。修改为:X=1,Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能满足条件。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌。如果需要玩4轮，就把连报轮数设定为4。报13 4=去掉1张面牌。第3轮4轮位置最大" = "Announces how many face cards to discard; it can secure the highest position for the most rounds across multiple rounds. The range for discarding face cards is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=1, Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the top 5 cards. Female voice 0 = the condition is met without discarding any cards. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition. If you want to play 4 rounds, set the consecutive-round count to 4. An announcement of 13 4 = discard 1 face card; the highest position in rounds 3 and 4";
"报去掉多少张面牌，可保多轮同点且无9点。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1，Y=10。表示在上10张内三掉面牌。修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内，去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能满足条件。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌,如果需要玩4轮，就把连报轮数设定为4，报134=去掉1张面牌。第3轮4轮同点且无9点" = "Announces how many face cards to discard; it can secure the same points with no 9 points across multiple rounds. The range for discarding face cards is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=1, Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the top 5 cards. Female voice 0 = the condition is met without discarding any cards. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition. If you want to play 4 rounds, set the consecutive-round count to 4. An announcement of 134 = discard 1 face card; the same points with no 9 points in rounds 3 and 4";
"报去掉多少张面牌，可保有上活门同时报哪家最大。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌，修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌" = "Announces how many face cards to discard; it can secure an upper live gate and at the same time announce which player is highest. The range for discarding face cards is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards; changed to X=1, Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the top 5 cards. Female voice 0 = the highest position is locked without discarding any cards. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition";
"报去掉多少张面牌，可保有下活门同时报哪家最大。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌，修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌" = "Announces how many face cards to discard; it can secure a lower live gate and at the same time announce which player is highest. The range for discarding face cards is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards; changed to X=1, Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the top 5 cards. Female voice 0 = the highest position is locked without discarding any cards. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition";
"报去掉多少张面牌，可保有活门同时报哪家最大。去面牌范围由参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内去掉面牌，修改为:X=1，Y=5表示在前5张内去掉面牌。女声0=不用去牌也能保位置最大。男声0=找不到满足条件的牌" = "Announces how many face cards to discard; it can secure a live gate and at the same time announce which player is highest. The range for discarding face cards is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning face cards are discarded within the top 10 cards; changed to X=1, Y=5 means face cards are discarded within the top 5 cards. Female voice 0 = the highest position is locked without discarding any cards. Male voice 0 = no card meets the condition";
"报各家大小排名，人数超过6家只报前6家" = "Announces each player's ranking; if there are more than 6 players, only the top 6 are announced";
"报哪2家最大和哪个位置是活门,合成语音不支持连报多轮.人数>4 :报1大2大+第1活门+第2活门" = "Announces which 2 players are highest and which position is the live gate. The synthesized voice does not support consecutive announcements across multiple rounds. Players > 4: announces 1 highest, 2 highest + the 1st live gate + the 2nd live gate";
"报哪2家最大次大" = "Announces which 2 players are the highest and second highest";
"报哪2家最小" = "Announces which 2 players are the lowest";
"报哪个位置是活门。" = "Announces which position is the live gate.";
"报哪个位置看色牌，放回原处。根据色牌发牌，报哪个位置最大\n" = "Announces which position to peek at the marked card, then put it back. Deal according to the marked card, and announce which player is highest\n";
"报哪家最大" = "Announces which player is highest";
"报哪家最大和最大家是什么牌。Y=10报点数。 Y不等于10:报点数和花色" = "Announce which player has the highest hand and what that hand is. If Y=10, announce the points. If Y is not 10: announce the points and the suit";
"报哪家最大和最大家是什么牌型。" = "Announces which player is highest and what hand type the highest player has.";
"报哪家最小" = "Announces which player is lowest";
"报在第几张牌处打色留色，再根据色牌点数去面牌，可保位置最大。比如报3，上面3张打色留色，色牌是5再去5张面牌，J是去掉11张。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1Y=10。表示在上10张内打色。修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色" = "Announces at which card to mark and keep marked, then discards face cards according to the marked card's points; it can lock the highest position. For example, an announcement of 3 means the top 3 cards are marked and kept, and if the marked card is a 5, discard 5 more face cards, while a J discards 11. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=5, Y=10 means marking within cards 5 through 10";
"报在第几张牌处打色留色，再根据色牌点数去面牌，可保位置最大次大。比如报3，上面3张打色留色，色牌是5再去5张面牌，J是去掉11张。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1，Y=10。表示在上10张内打色。修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色" = "Announces at which card to mark and keep marked, then discards face cards according to the marked card's points; it can lock the highest and second-highest positions. For example, an announcement of 3 means the top 3 cards are marked and kept, and if the marked card is a 5, discard 5 more face cards, while a J discards 11. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=5, Y=10 means marking within cards 5 through 10";
"报在第几张牌处打色，去掉色牌本身，从上开始发，可保位置最大。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上下10张内打色。修改为:X=5，Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色或倒数第5张到倒数第10张" = "Announces at which card to mark, discard the marked card itself, and deal from the top; it can lock the highest position. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top and bottom 10 cards. Changed to X=5, Y=10 means marking within cards 5 through 10, or the 5th through 10th cards from the bottom";
"报在第几张牌处打色，去掉色牌本身，从上开始发，可保位置最大次大。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10。表示在上下10张内打色。修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色或倒数第5张到倒数第10张。" = "Announces at which card to mark, discard the marked card itself, and deal from the top; it can lock the highest and second-highest positions. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top and bottom 10 cards. Changed to X=5, Y=10 means marking within cards 5 through 10, or the 5th through 10th cards from the bottom.";
"报在第几张牌处打色，去掉色牌本身，从上开始发，可保位置最小。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上下10张内打色。修改为:X=5,Y-10表示在第5张到第10张内打色或倒数第5张到倒数第10张" = "Announces at which card to mark, discard the marked card itself, and deal from the top; it can lock the lowest position. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top and bottom 10 cards. Changed to X=5, Y-10 means marking within cards 5 through 10, or the 5th through 10th cards from the bottom";
"报在第几张牌处打色，去掉色牌本身，从上开始发，可保位置最小次小。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1，Y=10.表示在上作10张内打色。修改为:X=5，Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色或倒数第5张到倒数第10张。" = "Announces at which card to mark, discard the marked card itself, and deal from the top; it can lock the lowest and second-lowest positions. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=5, Y=10 means marking within cards 5 through 10, or the 5th through 10th cards from the bottom.";
"报在第几张牌处打色，去掉色牌，从上开始发可保位置最大。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1，Y=10.表示在上10张内打色。 修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色" = "Announces at which card to mark, discard the marked card, and deal from the top; it can lock the highest position. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=5, Y=10 means marking within cards 5 through 10";
"报在第几张牌处打色，去掉色牌，从上开始发可保位置最大次大。打色范围有参数XY设定默认X=1，Y=10.表示在上10张内打色。 修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色" = "Announces at which card to mark, discard the marked card, and deal from the top; it can lock the highest and second-highest positions. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=5, Y=10 means marking within cards 5 through 10";
"报在第几张牌处打色，去掉色牌，从上开始发可保位置最小。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在上10张内打色。 修改为X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色。" = "Announces at which card to mark, discard the marked card, and deal from the top; it can lock the lowest position. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=5, Y=10 means marking within cards 5 through 10.";
"报在第几张牌处打色，去掉色牌，从上开始发可保位置最小次小。打色范围有参数XY设定默认X=1，Y=10。表示在上10张内打色。修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色。" = "Announces at which card to mark, discard the marked card, and deal from the top; it can lock the lowest and second-lowest positions. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top 10 cards. Changed to X=5, Y=10 means marking within cards 5 through 10.";
"报在第几张牌处打色，色牌先发，可保位置最大次大。打色范围有参数XY设定:默认X=1,Y=10.表示在下10张内打色。 修改为:X=5,Y=10表示在倒数第5张到倒数第10张内打色。女=最大，男=次大" = "Announces at which card to mark; marked cards are dealt first; it can lock the highest and second-highest positions. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the bottom 10 cards. Changed to X=5, Y=10 means marking within the 5th through 10th cards from the bottom. Female = highest, male = second highest";
"报在第几张牌处打色，色牌先发，可保位置最小次小。打色范围有参数XY役道:默认X修改为:X=1,Y=10.表示在下10张内打色。X=5，Y=10表示在倒数第5张到倒数第10张内打色。女=最小，男=次小" = "Announces at which card to mark; marked cards are dealt first; it can lock the lowest and second-lowest positions. The mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the bottom 10 cards. X=5, Y=10 means marking within the 5th through 10th cards from the bottom. Female = lowest, male = second lowest";
"报在第几张牌处打色，色牌和色牌上部分的牌补到底部，再根据色牌点数去面牌，可保位置最大。比如报3，上面3张打色去色全部，色牌是5再去5张面牌，J是去掉11张\n打色范围有参数XY设定:默让X=1,Y=10。表示在上10张内打色，修改为：X=5，Y=10表示在第5张到第10张内打色。" = "Announces at which card to mark; the marked card and the cards above it are moved to the bottom, then face cards are discarded according to the marked card's points; it can lock the highest position. For example, an announcement of 3 means the top 3 cards are marked and all marked cards removed, and if the marked card is a 5, discard 5 more face cards, while a J discards 11\nThe mark range is set by parameters X and Y: the default is X=1, Y=10, meaning marking within the top 10 cards; changed to X=5, Y=10 means marking within cards 5 through 10.";
