"杭州小牌九 一共32张，每家发2张牌。\n1、选牌\n  红心2、方块2、黑桃4、红心4、梅花4、方块4、黑桃5、红心5、黑桃6、红心6、梅花6、方块6、黑桃7、红心7、梅花7、方块7、黑桃8、红心8、梅花8、方块8、黑桃9、红心9、  黑桃10、红心10、梅花10、方块10、黑桃J、梅花J、红心Q、方块Q、大王、黑桃3\n2、大小顺序：\n1）最大：对子，分红对和黑对, 同点红对 > 混对 > 黑对\n2）不成对时，Q+9 > Q+8 > 2+8 > 9点，0点最小，大王=6点，黑桃3=3点，J=1点，Q=2点\n3）同点时比最大牌\n4）最大牌也相同时，庄家赢。" = "Hangzhou Xiao Pai Gow uses 32 cards in total, and each player is dealt 2 cards.\n1. Card selection\n  Hearts 2, Diamonds 2, Spades 4, Hearts 4, Clubs 4, Diamonds 4, Spades 5, Hearts 5, Spades 6, Hearts 6, Clubs 6, Diamonds 6, Spades 7, Hearts 7, Clubs 7, Diamonds 7, Spades 8, Hearts 8, Clubs 8, Diamonds 8, Spades 9, Hearts 9,   Spades 10, Hearts 10, Clubs 10, Diamonds 10, Spades J, Clubs J, Hearts Q, Diamonds Q, Big Joker, Spades 3\n2. Ranking order:\n1) Highest: a pair, which is either a red pair or a black pair. At the same point value, a red pair > a mixed pair > a black pair\n2) When the two cards are not a pair, Q+9 > Q+8 > 2+8 > 9 points, and 0 points is the lowest. The Big Joker counts as 6 points, Spades 3 counts as 3 points, J counts as 1 point, and Q counts as 2 points\n3) If two players have the same points, compare their highest card\n4) If the highest cards are also the same, the dealer wins.";
