"比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最小。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最小" = "For example, an announcement of 1, 2 means that in the 1st round of dealing the 2nd and 3rd cards are swapped, which locks the position holding the lowest hand. An announcement of 1, 2; 2, 3 means that in the 1st round of dealing the 2nd and 3rd cards are swapped and in the 2nd round the 3rd and 4th cards are swapped, which locks the position holding the lowest hand";
"比如X=1 Y=10 报3，80%表示在1到10张内切牌，位置3拿最大牌概率是80%" = "For example, with X=1 and Y=10, an announcement of 3, 80% means that if you cut within the first 10 cards, position 3 has an 80% chance of getting the highest card";
"比如X=1，Y=10报3，80%表示在1到10张内切牌，位置3拿最大次大概率是80%\n" = "For example, with X=1 and Y=10, an announcement of 3, 80% means that if you cut within the first 10 cards, position 3 has an 80% chance of getting the highest and second highest cards\n";
"比如报15 18，表示在第15张或16张或17张或18张处切牌，指定的2个玩家中必有一个拿到最大牌。指定2个玩家由打色范围的XY设定。X=1 Y=3 表示玩家1和玩家3" = "For example, an announcement of 15 18 means that if you cut at the 15th, 16th, 17th or 18th card, one of the two specified players is guaranteed to get the highest card. The two specified players are set by the X and Y of the marking range: X=1 and Y=3 means player 1 and player 3";
"比如报2341，表示去掉2张面牌补到底部第2门是活门，最大家是第4家。去掉3张底牌补到顶部，第2门是活门，最大家是第1家.保第几门活门用Y参数设定。" = "For example, an announcement of 2341 means that if you take 2 face cards away and move them to the bottom, gate 2 is the live gate and player 4 holds the highest hand; and that if you take 3 bottom cards away and move them to the top, gate 2 is the live gate and player 1 holds the highest hand. Which gate is kept as the live gate is set by parameter Y.";
"比如报2344，表示去掉2张面牌补到底部可保第3门或第4门是最大，最大家是3。表示去掉4张底牌补到顶部可保第3门或第4门是最大，最大家是4.保 34门由XY修改设定。" = "For example, an announcement of 2344 means that if you take 2 face cards away and move them to the bottom, either gate 3 or gate 4 can be given the highest hand, and player 3 holds the highest hand; and that if you take 4 bottom cards away and move them to the top, either gate 3 or gate 4 can be given the highest hand, and player 4 holds the highest hand. Whether gate 3 or gate 4 is kept is set with X and Y.";
"比如报23，表示去掉2张面牌补到底部可保第1门最小且有2家同点。表示去掉3张底牌补到顶部可保第1门最小且有2家同点。保第几门由Y修改设定" = "For example, an announcement of 23 means that if you take 2 face cards away and move them to the bottom, gate 1 can be given the lowest hand with two players tied on points; and that if you take 3 bottom cards away and move them to the top, gate 1 can be given the lowest hand with two players tied on points. Which gate is kept is set with parameter Y";
"比如报23，表示去掉2张面牌补到底部可保第4门最大。表示去掉3张底牌补到顶部可保第4门最大。保第4门由Y修改设定，" = "For example, an announcement of 23 means that if you take 2 face cards away and move them to the bottom, gate 4 can be given the highest hand; and that if you take 3 bottom cards away and move them to the top, gate 4 can be given the highest hand. Keeping gate 4 is set with parameter Y,";
"比如报24，表示去掉2张面牌补到底部可保第3门或第4门是最大，最大家是4。保第几门门由XY修改设定比如保34门，设置X = 3, Y = 4。" = "For example, an announcement of 24 means that if you take 2 face cards away and move them to the bottom, either gate 3 or gate 4 can be given the highest hand, and player 4 holds the highest hand. Which gates are kept is set with X and Y: for example, to keep gates 3 and 4, set X = 3, Y = 4.";
"比如报24，表示去掉2张面牌补到底部可保第3门第4门是最大次大，最大家是4。保第几门门由XY修改设定比如保34门，设置X = 3, Y = 4。" = "For example, an announcement of 24 means that if you take 2 face cards away and move them to the bottom, gate 3 and gate 4 can be given the highest and second highest hands, and player 4 holds the highest hand. Which gates are kept is set with X and Y: for example, to keep gates 3 and 4, set X = 3, Y = 4.";
"比如报2，表示抽2次底牌面牌抽第1次把右手的底牌面牌放到左手，抽第2次继续把右手的底牌面牌放到左手，右手剩下牌的底牌为色牌，再把左手的牌补到又手牌的底部，根据色牌发牌，可保位置最大最大抽牌次数用Y参数设定" = "For example, an announcement of 2 means you pull the bottom face card twice: on the first pull you move the bottom face card from your right hand to your left hand, and on the second pull you again move the bottom face card from your right hand to your left hand. The bottom card of what is left in your right hand becomes the marked card. Then put the left-hand cards back under the right-hand cards and deal according to the marked card, which locks the position holding the highest hand. The maximum number of pulls is set with parameter Y";
"比如报4231，表示去掉6张时以6为色，位置比如报较4最大、去掉7张时以7为色，位置2最大，去掉8张时以8为色位置3最大，去掉9张时以9为色，位置1最大" = "For example, an announcement of 4231 means that if you take 6 cards away, card 6 is the marked card and position 4 holds the highest hand; if you take 7 cards away, card 7 is the marked card and position 2 holds the highest hand; if you take 8 cards away, card 8 is the marked card and position 3 holds the highest hand; and if you take 9 cards away, card 9 is the marked card and position 1 holds the highest hand";
"比如报52表示去掉5张面牌有活门2。支持多门活门。女声=活门概率>70%.男声=活门概率60%-70%。去牌范围可通过打色范围XY修改" = "For example, an announcement of 52 means that if you take 5 face cards away, gate 2 is a live gate. Several live gates are supported at once. A female voice means the live gate has a probability above 70%. A male voice means the live gate has a probability of 60%-70%. The range of cards taken away can be changed with the marking range X and Y";
"比如斗牛:Y设定为 5，报 122 3，按照122方式发牌，可保有2家同点3家不同点，且没有9\n        点.第3家最小发牌方式由Y参数设定:\nY=2:【11，2】\nY=3:【111,12,21，3】\nY=4:【1111,112,121,13,211,22,31,4】;\nY=5:【1112,113,122,131,14 2111 212,221, 23,311，32，41，5;\nY53:【113,122,131,212,221,311】\nY=54:【11111 1112 1121113,1211122,13114,2111.212221,23,31132.41】\nY=55:【23，32，14，41】" = "For example, in Dou Niu: with Y set to 5, an announcement of 122 3 means the cards are dealt in the 122 pattern, which keeps 2 players tied on points and 3 players on different points, with no 9\n        points. Player 3 holds the lowest hand. The dealing pattern is set with parameter Y:\nY=2: 【11，2】\nY=3: 【111,12,21，3】\nY=4: 【1111,112,121,13,211,22,31,4】;\nY=5: 【1112,113,122,131,14 2111 212,221, 23,311，32，41，5;\nY53: 【113,122,131,212,221,311】\nY=54: 【11111 1112 1121113,1211122,13114,2111.212221,23,31132.41】\nY=55: 【23，32，14，41】";
