"牌数:34每家2张牌。(黑桃A、红桃2、手法红桃5、4个6、4个7、4个8、红桃9、方块2、黑桃3、红桃3、4个4、方块5、\n方块9、4个10、红桃J,方块J,红桃Q、方块Q、大王)\n规则:\n1大小顺序(只区分黑、红，红桃=方块，黑桃=梅花)红Q>红2>红8>红4>红6(=\n切牌9(=黑 8=黑7=红5=大王=黑红10=黑4) >红J(=黑10=红7=黑6)>红\nA=黑 3=红3)\n2)先比对子(黑A+黑3是算一对子)，对子一样大庄赢。大王+黑3=大王+红三\n=黑A+黑3=黑A+红3>红Q>红2>红8>红4>红6(=红10=黑4)>红J(=黑10=红7=黑6)>红9(=黑8=黑7=红5)\n3)不成对子时，红Q+红9最大>红Q+红8=红Q+黑8，接着红2+红8=红2+黑8\n4)接下比点数。(Q=2点，J=1点，黑\n报法 A=6点，大王=6点)，点数相同比较最大牌\n5)最大牌相同时，庄家赢，同时0点一样大" = "Deck: 34 cards, 2 cards per player. (Ace of Spades, 2 of Hearts, technique 5 of Hearts, all four 6s, all four 7s, all four 8s, 9 of Hearts, 2 of Diamonds, 3 of Spades, 3 of Hearts, all four 4s, 5 of Diamonds,\n9 of Diamonds, all four 10s, J of Hearts, J of Diamonds, Q of Hearts, Q of Diamonds, Big Joker)\nRules:\n1. Card ranking (only red and black matter: Hearts = Diamonds, Spades = Clubs): red Q > red 2 > red 8 > red 4 > red 6 (=\ncut 9 (= black 8 = black 7 = red 5 = Big Joker = black or red 10 = black 4) > red J (= black 10 = red 7 = black 6) > red\nA = black 3 = red 3)\n2) Compare pairs first (a black A with a black 3 counts as a pair); if two pairs are equal, the dealer wins. Big Joker + black 3 = Big Joker + red 3\n= black A + black 3 = black A + red 3 > red Q > red 2 > red 8 > red 4 > red 6 (= red 10 = black 4) > red J (= black 10 = red 7 = black 6) > red 9 (= black 8 = black 7 = red 5)\n3) When no pair is made, red Q + red 9 is the highest > red Q + red 8 = red Q + black 8, followed by red 2 + red 8 = red 2 + black 8\n4) Next compare points. (Q = 2 points, J = 1 point, black\nannouncement: A = 6 points, Big Joker = 6 points); if the points are the same, compare the highest card\n5) If the highest cards are the same as well, the dealer wins; all 0-point hands are equal";
