"看自己手里的第一张牌，报下轮是否有生死门。会报4个结果，根据自己的第一张牌是发牌中的第几张选择一个结果。比如报:1张2，2张0，3张0，4张0.如果自己是发牌的第1张，选择“1张2”表示下轮有活门 2.如果自己是发牌的第2张，选择“2张0-”表示下轮没有活门\n    5-10人玩:报1张高2，2张3，高2表示活门是第2门，赢的概率大于70%。没有报高赢的概率大于60%小于70%" = "Look at the first card in your own hand, and the app announces whether the next round has a live or dead gate. It gives 4 results, and you pick the one matching which card of the deal your first card was. For example it announces: card 1: 2, card 2: 0, card 3: 0, card 4: 0. If your card was the 1st card dealt, choose \"card 1: 2\", which means the next round has a live gate at gate 2. If your card was the 2nd card dealt, choose \"card 2: 0-\", which means the next round has no live gate\n    With 5-10 players: it announces card 1 high 2, card 2: 3. \"High 2\" means the live gate is gate 2 and the chance of winning is over 70%. When \"high\" is not announced, the chance of winning is over 60% but under 70%";
