"看色牌(第1张色牌)，色牌下面查找第2张色牌，第1张色牌和第2张色牌点数和为最终色点，\n根据最终色点发牌，保位置最大最终色点计算规则:\n比如2张色牌为10，5，\nY=10 情况下:最终色点=10 +5 =15-10=5\nY 不等于 10情况下:最终色点= 10 +5 =15\n报牌张数 =1:报第2张色牌位置+2张色牌点数。比如报5、2:第2张色牌是第5张，且点数-2点。\n报牌张数>1: 报第2张色牌位置。比如报牌张数=3.报 2,3.4:第2张色牌可以是第2张或3张或4张" = "Peek at the marked card (the 1st marked card), then look below it for the 2nd marked card; the points of the 1st and the 2nd marked card added together give the final mark point,\nDeal according to the final mark point so that the highest position is locked. The final mark point is calculated like this:\nFor example, if the two marked cards are 10 and 5,\nWhen Y = 10: final mark point = 10 + 5 = 15 - 10 = 5\nWhen Y is not 10: final mark point = 10 + 5 = 15\nWhen the number of announced cards = 1: it announces the position of the 2nd marked card plus the total points of the two marked cards. For example, an announcement of 5, 2 means the 2nd marked card is the 5th card and the mark point is 2.\nWhen the number of announced cards > 1: it announces only the possible positions of the 2nd marked card. For example, if the number of announced cards = 3 and it announces 2, 3, 4, the 2nd marked card can be the 2nd, the 3rd or the 4th card";
