"设置选连续看底，如果不能看底，设定切牌设置=看手牌。先报各玩家手里的牌，照任意牌，报该牌的后续4张。\nX=1报单张的点数。\nX>1 报单张的点数和花色" = "In Settings choose continuous peek at the bottom card; if you cannot peek at the bottom card, set the cut setting to Peek at the hand. It first announces the cards in each player's hand, then for any card you scan it announces the next 4 cards after it.\nX = 1: it announces only the rank of the single card.\nX > 1: it announces both the rank and the suit of the single card";
