"识别色牌后放回原处牌堆不变。若同时选择先看底/看顶，则是第一次看顶/看底，第二次看色后再报牌。\n去掉色牌本身。比如:报1，2=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，可保位置最大。报1，2;2，3=发牌的第1轮的第2张和第3张交换，第2轮的第3张和第4张交换。可保位置最大" = "After the marked card is recognized, put it back where it was so the deck stays unchanged. If you also choose to peek at the bottom or the top card first, the first pass is the peek at the top or bottom card and the announcement comes only after the second pass over the marked card.\nThe marked card itself is discarded. For example: An announcement of 1, 2 means swapping the 2nd and the 3rd card of the 1st round of dealing, which locks the highest position. An announcement of 1, 2; 2, 3 means swapping the 2nd and the 3rd card of the 1st round and the 3rd and the 4th card of the 2nd round, which locks the highest position";
